Z||000012||Raydar||02-28-2001||11:19 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Phil:<BR><B>They even made a movie about the very same thing. Can't remember the name of it or if it was a TV or regular movie.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Think the name of the movie was Capricorn I, or something like that.<P>My wife and I had this conversation a few days ago. <BR>How many people worked on the Apollo program? Hundreds? Thousands?<BR>Isn't it likely that, if it really was a hoax, someone would have blabbed by now? Wouldn't someone have smuggled out some concrete proof? Wouldn't someone say "I was there. It never happened."?<BR>Merely an opinion. I'm convinced it was real. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
